# An invented campaign of a demo project, for derive, join and run: no real project, team or
# person. The shape is Buraqueira's campaign map, with the pull left out: the test feeds the
# table in, and the pairing key comes from the test derivation in pair-key.ts.
recipe campaign-map
  | One row per design task of the demo campaign, its copy and its media paired.
param team = design

derive pair-key
join copy left="team = {team}" right="team = copy" on=pair_key
join media left="team = {team}" right="team = media" on=pair_key bring=key
where team = {team}
select key, title, status, copy_key, copy_status, copy_match, media_key, media_match
show table
keep campaign-map
